# Project Rules

## Stack
- Language/framework: TypeScript, React 19, Vite 6
- Package manager: npm
- Testing: Vitest, React Testing Library

## Conventions
- Commit messages follow Conventional Commits (feat, fix, docs, chore, refactor, test)
- Code formatted with <prettier/eslint — name your setup>
- Branch naming: feature/*, fix/*

## Commands
- Install deps: `npm install`
- Run dev server: `npm run dev`
- Run tests: `npm test`